---
pagination:
  data: research
  size: 25
  alias: pageEntries
permalink: "{% if pagination.pageNumber == 0 %}/{% else %}/page/{{ pagination.pageNumber | plus1 }}/{% endif %}"
layout: base.njk
eleventyComputed:
  # Empty (not "null") on page 0 — base.njk's <title> only prepends
  # "<title> · " when title is truthy, so leaving this blank there
  # falls through to the bare "AtlasLatino" tab title as intended.
  title: "{% if pagination.pageNumber > 0 %}Page {{ pagination.pageNumber | plus1 }}{% endif %}"
---
{#
  The home page is deliberately compact: the feed starts near the top.
  The long "what this is" paragraph lives on /about/ instead. "Add
  yourself or your research" isn't repeated here since it's already in
  the footer on every page. "Browse by event" / "Browse by field, type,
  or country" aren't repeated here either — both are top nav items now
  (Events, Browse), so a duplicate link right below would just be noise.

  Paginated at 25 entries per page once the feed stops being small
  enough to browse as one flat list — see src/_data/research.js for
  why the sort order stays stable across pages (a comparator that
  doesn't return 0 for ties would silently reshuffle entries between
  page loads, which is exactly the kind of bug that's invisible until
  someone hits page 2 of a long feed and sees an entry twice, or not
  at all).
#}
{# The design keeps the home page chrome-free, but the document still
   needs a top-level heading: without it the site's main entry point
   starts at h2 for anyone navigating by heading level. #}
<h1 class="visually-hidden">AtlasLatino — research feed{% if pagination.pageNumber > 0 %}, page {{ pagination.pageNumber | plus1 }}{% endif %}</h1>

<div class="section-bar">
  <h2 class="section-title">
    Research feed
    <span class="count">— {{ research.length }} {{ "entry" if research.length == 1 else "entries" }}</span>
  </h2>
</div>

{% if pageEntries.length %}
  <ul class="feed">
    {% for entry in pageEntries %}
      {% include "feed-item.njk" %}
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>

  {% include "pager.njk" %}
{% else %}
  <p class="empty-note">No research entries yet. <a href="https://github.com/verovaleros/atlaslatino">Be the first to add one.</a></p>
{% endif %}
